msgid "MMM End-to-End Case Study"
msgstr "Caso de Estudio Completo de MMM"

#: ../source/gallery/notebooks/mmm/mmm_case_study.ipynb:10005
#: 8fd64c2ed0294e01b41159a5050c6d18
msgid ""
"In today's competitive business landscape, optimizing marketing spend "
"across channels is crucial for maximizing return on investment and "
"driving business growth. This notebook demonstrates how to leverage PyMC-"
"Marketing's Media Mix Modeling (MMM) to gain actionable insights into "
"marketing effectiveness and optimize budget allocation."
msgstr ""
"En el competitivo entorno empresarial actual, optimizar el gasto de "
"marketing en todos los canales es crucial para maximizar el retorno de "
"inversión y fomentar el crecimiento empresarial. Este cuaderno muestra "
"cómo aprovechar el Modelado de Mezcla de Medios (MMM) de PyMC-Marketing "
"para obtener ideas útiles sobre la efectividad del marketing y optimizar "
"la asignación del presupuesto."

#: ../source/gallery/notebooks/mmm/mmm_case_study.ipynb:10007
#: ed483b6043c446ecaeda78a0d969d350
msgid ""
"We'll walk through a real-world case study using data from a [PyData "
"Global 2022](https://pydata.org/global2022/) presentation ([Hajime Takeda"
" - Media Mix Modeling:How to Measure the Effectiveness of "
"Advertising](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u4U_PUTasPQ)). Our goal is "
"to show how MMM can help marketing teams:"
msgstr ""
"Recorreremos un caso de estudio del mundo real utilizando datos de una "
"presentación de [PyData Global 2022](https://pydata.org/global2022/) "
"([Hajime Takeda - Media Mix Modeling: How to Measure the Effectiveness of"
" Advertising](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u4U_PUTasPQ)). Nuestro "
"objetivo es mostrar cómo el MMM puede ayudar a los equipos de marketing:"

